# Naming & Folders

Full doc: `docs/standards/naming-and-folders.md`

```
src/features/{FeatureName}/pages|components|hooks|stores|types.ts|query-keys.ts
```

| Kind | Pattern |
|------|---------|
| Page | `{Entity}Page.tsx` |
| Hook | `use{Entity}{Action}.ts` |
| Hook test | `use{Entity}{Action}.test.ts` |
| Page test | `{Entity}Page.test.tsx` |
| Query keys | `{entity}Keys` in `query-keys.ts` |
| Zod | `{entity}FormSchema` |

Feature folders: PascalCase singular (`Clients`, `TimeLogs`).
Routes: kebab-case paths. Tests colocated with source.
